        <head>CHEERY HOME</head>
        <p>A CHEERY HOME</p>
        <p>- at even-tide, Is the m9st comfortable hope in these shortening autumn days. liaPiry f 411111 Y, cosy ere- side-corner, puss purring on the hearth. ketti, croon- ing on the hob and—realest treat of all—Brooke Bonds' steaming cup that cheers and warms the cockles o' the heart—all here to prove there's no. place like home</p>
