      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-10-12_WidnesExaminer_art0069" n="art0069">
        <head>011 MY, Hero of the Balloon.</head>
        <p>011 MY, Hero of the Balloon.</p>
        <p>FITS OR EPILESPY,</p>
        <p>GIDDINESS, SENSATIONS, PAINTS. I will demonstr ita to the whole world how tint most dresdful of all complaints. Epilepsy," wiaich has been hitherto &amp;mei ered incurable, can be permanently cured (without the chance of failure). Write to the " Secretsry," Burwood House, Burwood Place, 'Hyde Park, London. Be will send you, "Gratis." full instructions for cure.</p>
